    "summary": "The user asks the assistant for advice on how to categorize customer transcripts that use non-standard grammar and slang (specifically African American Vernacular English or similar dialects) for a training manual. The assistant provides suggestions for categorizing these speech patterns, initially suggesting they be excluded for being \"unprofessional\" before pivoting to more neutral linguistic descriptors.",
